5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to avoid assumptions. Let’s look at the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to check the partition wall to the office and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m picking the round trip for a hot lunch and the invoices for outside hire by the hour.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m taking the quotes for the two fit-outs and the facilities callouts on this floor. Numbers first, opinions later.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I will examine the crumbs and bins at the desks, and the unplanned talk since the refit.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I appreciate the direct approach. We need data to replace the current first-come, first-served chaos.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. The data will show us if we are actually using the space, or just avoiding each other.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"Jonathan, that’s a bit dramatic. I’m just checking if we’re paying for convenience or actually saving time.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"May, checking invoices is sensible. But without the fit-out quotes, you’re just guessing at the cost. I’ll have those figures ready.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Shunichi, you are right. Numbers ground us. But I wonder if we are measuring the room, or the silence between us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Servas, that is poetic, but irrelevant. We need objective metrics, not emotional interpretations. The tally will reveal the actual usage patterns.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Ryuji, I hear your need for clarity. But metrics alone won’t heal the distance. We must consider how the space feels, not just how it’s used.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"Ryuji, calling it irrelevant is harsh. I’m just checking if we’re paying for convenience or actually saving time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Ryuji, silence is a metric too. If the room is empty, the cost is zero. I’ll prove that with the callout logs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, silence is not empty; it is full of unspoken things. I will listen to what the crumbs and the talk reveal.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will not debate philosophy. The tally and the fridge clear-out will provide the concrete facts we need to proceed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Ryuji"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Ryuji: I will not debate philosophy. The tally and the fridge clear-out will provide the concrete facts we need to proceed.""}]}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I respect your focus on facts. But please remember, the room’s purpose is also about connection, not just occupancy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"Ryuji, facts are great, but they don’t pay the bills. I’m just making sure we aren’t bleeding hours into a void.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Ryuji, stop being dramatic. The fridge is a liability, not a mystery. I’ll handle the financials; you handle the clutter.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, facts are the skeleton, but connection is the breath. I will listen to what the crumbs and the talk reveal.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
