35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The data confirms the imbalance. Two people dominate usage, and one person repeatedly cleans up. This validates my concern about unfair burden distribution.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The wall is thin, and the last difficult talk happened in full view. We need privacy to speak honestly, not just space to sit.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Twenty-five minutes for lunch, plus sixty-eight thousand yen for a room we barely use. We are bleeding hours and money.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Eleven callouts, zero for the empty store. The room is a magnet for problems. I have the fit-out quotes; they are steep, but the data is undeniable.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The crumbs show we eat in silence, and the talk has moved to the printer. We are isolated by our own habits.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Jonathan, your privacy point is valid, but the tally shows the real issue is unequal access. We must address the structural imbalance before discussing feelings.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Ryuji, structure matters, but without privacy, we cannot even begin to address those imbalances. We need a place to speak safely.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"Jonathan, privacy is nice, but it doesn’t feed us. We’re losing twenty-five minutes daily to lunch. That’s real time, not just feelings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"May, twenty-five minutes is trivial compared to two hundred thirty-seven thousand yen. I’m not paying for feelings; I’m paying for a working kitchen.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Shunichi, the yen is real, but so is the hunger for connection. We must feed both the body and the spirit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Shunichi, the fridge data proves the burden falls on one person. We need a system, not just a kitchen. Who cleans up after the others?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Ryuji, a system without trust is just a cage. If we cannot speak privately, the rules will only breed resentment, not cooperation.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"Ryuji, stop blaming the fridge. I’m looking at the invoices. We paid for a room we barely use. That’s the real waste.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Ryuji, the fridge is a symptom, not the disease. The quotes show the kitchen costs nearly a hundred thousand yen. I need to see the monthly burn rate before we commit.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, the fridge is a mirror. We see our neglect in it. Let us clean the room, and perhaps the resentment will dissolve with the crumbs.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I will not accept poetic deflection. The data shows a clear, unfair pattern. We need a concrete rule for cleaning duties, not metaphors about mirrors.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Ryuji, I hear your frustration. But rules cannot fix what silence has broken. We need a space where we can actually talk, not just clean.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"Ryuji, stop with the mirrors. I’m looking at the ledger. We paid for a room we barely use. That’s the real waste.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Ryuji, stop. The quotes are 141,000 and 96,000 yen. That is 237,000 yen total. I need the monthly burn rate before we agree to anything.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, the mirror is not a deflection; it is a truth. We must see ourselves clearly before we can fix the room.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
