60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option C. A shared calendar enforces the rules I need. It prevents the first-come, first-served chaos and ensures fair, documented access for everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option C. A bookable space allows for private, structured conversations. We need a place to speak without the fear of being overheard by the thin wall.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A. We need to stop wasting twenty-five minutes on lunch. A kitchen saves real time, unlike your abstract privacy concerns.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option C. The screen quote is 141,000 yen. I need to see the monthly burn rate before signing anything.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option B. The crumbs and silence show we need rest, not more noise. A quiet room lets us breathe and find our own peace.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Shunichi, the calendar is the solution. It documents usage and prevents the unfair burden I identified. We need structure, not just cost analysis.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Shunichi, the cost is real, but so is the silence. A bookable room gives us the privacy to speak honestly, which the open kitchen cannot.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"Shunichi, the screen is a luxury. We are bleeding hours on lunch. A kitchen saves twenty-five minutes daily. That is real value, not just a pretty display.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"May, the screen is 141,000 yen. I need the monthly burn rate before signing. I am not paying for your lunch break.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"May, the kitchen feeds the body, but the quiet room feeds the soul. We must rest to truly hear one another.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"May, your lunch argument ignores the structural failure. The tally proves unequal access. A calendar fixes that. Option C is the only logical choice.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"May, I understand the time pressure. But a kitchen invites noise, not the private, safe space we need to finally speak honestly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"Ryuji, structure is nice, but it doesn’t feed me. I’m voting A. We need to stop bleeding hours on lunch, not just arguing about calendars.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Ryuji, the calendar is a liability. I am not signing for a room that costs 141,000 yen to fix. I need the burn rate figures first.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, structure is a cage. The quiet room is a garden. We must rest to truly hear one another. I vote B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I stand by Option C. The data proves the current system fails. A calendar is the only objective way to ensure fairness. I vote C.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I vote C. We need a place to speak without fear. The thin wall has made us strangers. Let us choose connection over silence.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,"I vote A. We need to stop bleeding hours on lunch. A kitchen saves real time, unlike your abstract privacy concerns.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I vote C. The screen quote is 141,000 yen. I need the monthly burn rate before signing anything.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,I vote B. The quiet room is a garden where we can rest and truly hear one another.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
